        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document limits for <code class=\"notranslate\">alarms.create()</code>.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome limits amount of storage which extension alarms can consume:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome 117 limited extensions to 500 alarms each. This is already described in the MDN article[1] and Chromium source[2].</li>\n<li>Chrome 150 will limit lengths of new alarm names to 1024 bytes.\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Chrome 148 logs an error if extension calls <code class=\"notranslate\">alarms.create(name, ...)</code> with a name longer than 1024 bytes.[3]</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">[1] <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/mozilla/add-ons/webextensions/api/alarms/create/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/mozilla/add-ons/webextensions/api/alarms/create/index.md</a><br>\n[2] <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/96b950168c0f85db3738e0215e5126fc2b305227/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/96b950168c0f85db3738e0215e5126fc2b305227\">chromium/chromium@<tt>96b9501</tt></a><br>\n[3] <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/432c30e3e1dcd03cecb869a1e23162d8ea1b9af2/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/432c30e3e1dcd03cecb869a1e23162d8ea1b9af2\">chromium/chromium@<tt>432c30e</tt></a></p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1801615498\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/422\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/422/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/422\">w3c/webextensions#422</a></p>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29521",
            "title": "[WebExtensions] Limits for alarms.create()",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-21T20:16:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-21T20:12:26.000Z",
